@Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress = http://localhost:5219

### 1. Enqueue Welcome Email Job
POST {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/welcome-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "hitesh@example.com",
  "name": "Hitesh Choudhary"
}

###

### 2. Enqueue Order Confirmation Email Job
POST {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/order-confirmation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "customer@example.com",
  "orderId": "ORD-9842",
  "amount": 1499.00
}

###

### 3. Check Pending Jobs Count in Queue
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/queue-length
Accept: application/json

###
